  "title": "Hearty Smoky Saudi Arabian Chicken Kebabs",
  "description": "A quick and flavorful Saudi Arabian dish featuring smoky paprika and a mirepoix base, perfect for a low calorie friendly meal. This recipe is a floral and fluffy twist on traditional kebabs.",
